[12:33] [scene:talk]
VISUAL: 
AUDIO: 'quality and texture than other turbo models like Z Image Turbo. Now, it might not fully match Ideogram 4 when it comes to raw prompt adherence or highly complex scenes, but Ideogram is'

[12:45] [scene:talk]
